sequenceDiagram
 participant C as Client
 participant B as Booking
 participant I as Inventory
 participant P as Payment mock
 participant N as Notification mock
 C->>B: POST /api/v1/bookings and key
 B-->>C: 202 accepted statusUrl
 B->>I: HTTP reserve stable key
 I-->>B: 201 reservation price
 B->>P: HTTP charge stable key
 alt payment known successful
 P-->>B: 201 charged
 B->>I: HTTP confirm
 I-->>B: 200 confirmed
 Note over B: local commit CONFIRMED and outbox
 B->>N: HTTP deliver stable key
 N-->>B: 201 mock delivery
 else timeout or stopped
 Note over B: keep PAYMENT_PENDING and reserved seat
 B->>P: Retry same key with backoff and jitter
 else definitive decline
 P-->>B: 402 declined
 B->>I: HTTP release
 I-->>B: 200 released
 Note over B: REJECTED
 end
